      <h1 class="article__title" data-pagefind-meta="title">GTA 6 Beginner Tips: Start Strong in 2026</h1>
      <p class="article__meta">
        <span class="article__updated">Last updated <time datetime="2026-11-18" data-pagefind-meta="updated[datetime]">18 Nov 2026</time></span>
